msgid ""
"(`gh-32423 <https://github.com/numpy/numpy/pull/32423>`__, `gh-32508 "
"<https://github.com/numpy/numpy/pull/32508>`__, `gh-32562 <https://github."
"com/numpy/numpy/pull/32562>`__)"
msgstr ""

